---
import ComputerLayout from "@/layouts/computer-layout.astro";
---

<ComputerLayout
	appId="colophon"
	title="Colophon"
	description="The artists and resources behind this computer."
>
	<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-8">
		<p>
			Application icons are from <a href="https://github.com/shlinux/faenza-icon-theme"
				>Faenza by Matthieu James</a
			>, licensed under the GNU GPL version 3. The artwork is unmodified;
			<a href="/icons/faenza/LICENSE.txt">license</a>,
			<a href="/icons/faenza/AUTHORS.txt">credits</a>, and
			<a href="/icons/faenza/README.txt">artwork sources</a> are included locally.
		</p>
		<p>
			Cursor artwork is from <a href="https://www.streamlinehq.com/icons/plump-remix-free"
				>Plump Remix Free by Streamline</a
			>, licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>.
		</p>
		<p>
			The cursor artwork has been resized, padded, and given an opaque white interior and a white
			outline for contrast. Minimize and close are original interface glyphs.
		</p>
	</div>
</ComputerLayout>
